**Stacked:** includes #366's commit (`f69c8ed4c`, Sheep Shearer / Romeo & Juliet); please review and merge after #366. Only the last commit is new.

Content area from OpenRune/OpenRune-Server#353 (answers there: all of it, one PR per row, ids renumbered against main, wiki data is fine).

From our per-feature patches `12-quests-sheep-shearer-romeo-juliet`, `66-goblin-diplomacy` (in [`openrune/upstream/`](https://github.com/AlexPerrin/osrs-plugins-reverse/tree/main/openrune/upstream) of osrs-plugins-reverse), on `main` (`1be5dfb5f`).

Stacked on the Sheep Shearer / Romeo & Juliet PR (its `QuestTalkFixture`); only the last commit is new here. Merged after that PR, this one shows only its own commit.

**Problem.** Goblin Diplomacy was not implemented (the generals and Grubfoot only had flavour talk), and the Goblin Village lookout ladder had no handler.

**Change.** New quest on the client varbit `gobdip_main` (2378): 0, 3 started (orange wanted), 4 blue wanted, 5 brown wanted, 6 complete.
- The three armour crates use `gobdip_crate1..3_searched` and Grubfoot's look the multinpc varbit `gobdip_grubfoot_vis`, so the client and Quest Helper see them.
- Random openers, topic menu, start, the three try-ons as dialogue; orange/blue dye on goblin mail and dye mixing (red+yellow, yellow+blue, red+blue), one transaction each.
- Rewards: 5 QP, 200 Crafting XP, a gold bar.
- `GoblinGenerals.kt` / `Grubfoot.kt` (from #328) are folded into the quest; their dialogue is kept as the no-quest / after-quest talk.
- The lookout ladder by the south gate (`goblin_ladder_bottom/top`) climbs between level 0 and level 2.
- `QuestTalkFixture` gains a fixed random value and a generic `interact()`.

**Tests.** `GoblinDiplomacyInteractionTest`, plus the quest suites it builds on.

On this branch (Docker `eclipse-temurin:21`, upstream's `./gradlew`, 4 GB container; a clean `freshCache` of main restored first, then `:or-cache:buildCache :or-cache:mergePluginGamevals`, then each task as a separate run, then `run` to "Server ready"): buildCache pass, `spotlessCheck` pass, `assemble` pass, `test` pass, `integration` pass, boot pass (Server ready in 7.703108098s). `tools/scripts/fix_gameval_conflicts.py --check` finds no conflicts on this branch, nor with all of our open content PRs merged together.

Nothing was checked in game from this exact branch; the in-game checks above were on our own server build (an older main plus these and our other patches).

**Data sources.** OSRS Wiki (by the wiki's contributors, CC BY-NC-SA 3.0, https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/3.0/): the dialogue follows the wiki transcript. Step values: Quest Helper (BSD).

**Caveats.**
- The start value 3 is inferred from Quest Helper's steps.
- Guesses: the journal, the dye-mixing message, and "Human! Get us <colour> armour!" when asking for a new colour mid-quest.

**Release note.** Goblin Diplomacy is playable; the Goblin Village lookout ladder works.

